{
    "title": "LogicLike: Kids learning games",
    "description": "\ud83e\udde9LogicLike is an educational game for kids: abc puzzles and brain games for kids that foster learning and help children boost their thinking skills. Our kids' educational games and preschool learning games get automatically adapted to your child's age to drive their logic, memory and focus in the best possible way.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfeb LogicLike: abc puzzle and math kids educational games is a product of an experienced team of professional educators and teachers. We create logic puzzles and preschool learning games your child will love solving. On top of that, we take particular care of the design and animations not only to excite but also to reinforce the learning effect.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa8 Solving LogicLike puzzles and fun learning games for kids is a great exercise for children to advance their thinking skills. We recommend spending no more than 20 minutes a day playing LogicLike kid learning games and fun math games for kids. This way, your child won't be getting tired but will be getting used to learning. When it's the time, the kids' learning game will prompt the child to take a break. Breaks are important to stay focused and always have an eye for logic detail.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0a LogicLike games for children are designed to be useful, plain-clear and simple. The puzzles are intuitive and have voice overs. All tasks have exciting images and hints that help children stay motivated and engaged. Puzzles are smartly collected into games. Completing the games step-by-step is like doing a learning course. It is a particular advantage of LogicLike that you can solve puzzles in English or other languages.\r\n\r\n\u231b\ufe0f Designing logic puzzles is a difficult task that takes thousands of hours, and we are pleased to be doing it for eight years already. Our mission is to show children that learning can be fun, to engage them in learning, and help face challenges and never give up. We want the next generation to be smart and think out of the box. Check out for yourself, some puzzles are completely free for you to make sure the game is worth the effort. Children love puzzles, brain teasers and quizzes.\r\n\r\nEnjoy your time with LogicLike! Hope your children will have the best memories of their family leisure with our educational games!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd38 Why LogicLike: \ud83d\udd38\r\n\u2022 6,200+ puzzles\r\n\u2022 Exciting collections of hero cards\r\n\u2022 Various rankings\r\n\u2022 Appealing graphics of hints and tips\r\n\u2022 Revision of solutions\r\n\u2022 Certificates to share and print\r\n\u2022 Voiceover and nice background music\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd39 Scope of games: \ud83d\udd39\r\n\u2022 3D-geometry: figures, objects and their properties\r\n\u2022 Chess for beginners\r\n\u2022 Tables and fun math games for kids: Sudoku, Kakuro, Number Snail, etc.\r\n\u2022 Balance & weighing: liquids and solids\r\n\u2022 Elementary school topics and fun math games for kids: multiplication table, mental math, addition and deduction, multiplication and division.\r\n\u2022 Mathematics and preschool kid learning games: Grades 1 and 2\r\n\u2022 World Around Us: animals, countries and cities\r\n\u2022 True or false\r\n\u2022 Logic brain teasers: Odd One Out, Sets of Objects, Put in Order, Sort Objects and Jigsaw Puzzles.\r\n\u2022 All sorts of other topical preschool learning games for kids and toddlers.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcd9 New puzzle  and math educational games for kids are added to the library all the time.\r\n\ud83d\udcd7 The puzzles are great for kids of age 4+.\r\n\r\nPrivacy policy - https://logiclike.com/en/docs/privacy-app\r\nTerms of service - https://logiclike.com/en/docs/public-app\r\nAny questions - just drop us an email at office@logiclike.com\r\n\r\nWe are constantly updating LogicLike math, abc puzzle and fun educational games for kids to always experience the excitement of their leisure. If you liked our logic puzzle and kids educational games, please tell your friends about the LogicLike \ud83d\ude0a",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83e\udde9LogicLike is an educational game for kids: abc puzzles and brain games for kids that foster learning and help children boost their thinking skills. Our kids&#39; educational games and preschool learning games get automatically adapted to your child&#39;s age to drive their logic, memory and focus in the best possible way.<br><br>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfeb LogicLike: abc puzzle and math kids educational games is a product of an experienced team of professional educators and teachers. We create logic puzzles and preschool learning games your child will love solving. On top of that, we take particular care of the design and animations not only to excite but also to reinforce the learning effect.<br><br>\ud83c\udfa8 Solving LogicLike puzzles and fun learning games for kids is a great exercise for children to advance their thinking skills. We recommend spending no more than 20 minutes a day playing LogicLike kid learning games and fun math games for kids. This way, your child won&#39;t be getting tired but will be getting used to learning. When it&#39;s the time, the kids&#39; learning game will prompt the child to take a break. Breaks are important to stay focused and always have an eye for logic detail.<br><br>\ud83d\ude0a LogicLike games for children are designed to be useful, plain-clear and simple. The puzzles are intuitive and have voice overs. All tasks have exciting images and hints that help children stay motivated and engaged. Puzzles are smartly collected into games. Completing the games step-by-step is like doing a learning course. It is a particular advantage of LogicLike that you can solve puzzles in English or other languages.<br><br>\u231b\ufe0f Designing logic puzzles is a difficult task that takes thousands of hours, and we are pleased to be doing it for eight years already. Our mission is to show children that learning can be fun, to engage them in learning, and help face challenges and never give up. We want the next generation to be smart and think out of the box. Check out for yourself, some puzzles are completely free for you to make sure the game is worth the effort. Children love puzzles, brain teasers and quizzes.<br><br>Enjoy your time with LogicLike! Hope your children will have the best memories of their family leisure with our educational games!<br><br>\ud83d\udd38 Why LogicLike: \ud83d\udd38<br>\u2022 6,200+ puzzles<br>\u2022 Exciting collections of hero cards<br>\u2022 Various rankings<br>\u2022 Appealing graphics of hints and tips<br>\u2022 Revision of solutions<br>\u2022 Certificates to share and print<br>\u2022 Voiceover and nice background music<br><br>\ud83d\udd39 Scope of games: \ud83d\udd39<br>\u2022 3D-geometry: figures, objects and their properties<br>\u2022 Chess for beginners<br>\u2022 Tables and fun math games for kids: Sudoku, Kakuro, Number Snail, etc.<br>\u2022 Balance &amp; weighing: liquids and solids<br>\u2022 Elementary school topics and fun math games for kids: multiplication table, mental math, addition and deduction, multiplication and division.<br>\u2022 Mathematics and preschool kid learning games: Grades 1 and 2<br>\u2022 World Around Us: animals, countries and cities<br>\u2022 True or false<br>\u2022 Logic brain teasers: Odd One Out, Sets of Objects, Put in Order, Sort Objects and Jigsaw Puzzles.<br>\u2022 All sorts of other topical preschool learning games for kids and toddlers.<br><br>\ud83d\udcd9 New puzzle  and math educational games for kids are added to the library all the time.<br>\ud83d\udcd7 The puzzles are great for kids of age 4+.<br><br>Privacy policy - https://logiclike.com/en/docs/privacy-app<br>Terms of service - https://logiclike.com/en/docs/public-app<br>Any questions - just drop us an email at office@logiclike.com<br><br>We are constantly updating LogicLike math, abc puzzle and fun educational games for kids to always experience the excitement of their leisure. If you liked our logic puzzle and kids educational games, please tell your friends about the LogicLike \ud83d\ude0a",
